            where people can bask in the collection of all of
            humanity's knowledge. It is a place meant to explore
            and challenge ideas, find those who match our weird,
            and ultimately shape ourselves freely into who we wish
            to be.<br>
            <br>
            I believe that the internet is humanity's greatest
            culture, and it has never been properly viewed,
            understood, or respected as one. I feel this is a
            tragedy that betrays the entire collective efforts of
            everyone who has ever given anything to this world.
